<title>HONG KONG: W.I. Carr renamed Indosuez W.I. Carr Securities.</title>
<headline>W.I. Carr renamed Indosuez W.I. Carr Securities.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.I. Carr said in a statement on Wednesday it would be renamed Indosuez W.I. Carr Securities to reflect the integration of all Asian equity businesses within its parent Banque Indosuez.</p>
<p>Banque Indosuez is fully owned by France's Credit Agricole .</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
